{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1778977986277,"sessionID":"ses_1cca74304ffesK7pZ7OOL2KJ8q","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"read","callID":"call_oP3S2It9IdqvrPU7V2AhgNUO","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"filePath":"/__w/eval-ont-agent-cl/eval-ont-agent-cl/src/ontology/cl-edit.owl","offset":35195,"limit":40},"output":"<path>/__w/eval-ont-agent-cl/eval-ont-agent-cl/src/ontology/cl-edit.owl</path>\n<type>file</type>\n<content>\n35195: AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label obo:CL_4072046 \"pvalb chandelier GABAergic interneuron (Homo sapiens)\")\n35196: SubClassOf(obo:CL_4072046 obo:CL_4023036)\n35197: SubClassOf(obo:CL_4072046 ObjectSomeValuesFrom(obo:RO_0002162 obo:NCBITaxon_9606))\n35198: SubClassOf(obo:CL_4072046 ObjectSomeValuesFrom(obo:RO_0015004 obo:CLM_1000063))\n35199: \n35200: # Class: obo:CL_4072102 (Purkinje layer interneuron)\n35201: \n35202: AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"PMID:35803588\") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:CL_4072102 \"A type of GABAergic interneuron residing in the Purkinje cell layer of the cerebellar cortex.\")\n35203: AnnotationAssertion(terms:date obo:CL_4072102 \"2025-04-29T13:06:36Z\"^^xsd:dateTime)\n35204: AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"PMID:35803588\") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasSynonymType obo:OMO_0003000) oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym obo:CL_4072102 \"PLI\")\n35205: AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label obo:CL_4072102 \"Purkinje layer interneuron\")\n35206: EquivalentClasses(obo:CL_4072102 ObjectIntersectionOf(obo:CL_0000099 ObjectSomeValuesFrom(obo:RO_0002100 obo:UBERON_0002979)))\n35207: SubClassOf(obo:CL_4072102 ObjectSomeValuesFrom(obo:RO_0002215 obo:GO_0061534))\n35208: \n35209: # Class: obo:CL_4072103 (hair follicle dermal stem cell)\n35210: \n35211: AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"PMID:25465495\") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"PMID:29691589\") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"PMID:35036581\") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"PMID:35069694\") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:CL_4072103 \"A bipotent mesenchymal stem cell that resides in the dermal sheath, specifically within the dermal sheath cup at the base of the hair follicle, characterized by its capacity for self-renewal and differentiation into both dermal sheath and dermal papilla cells throughout hair cycling. In humans, this cell is marked by enriched expression of gremlin-2 (GREM2) and dipeptidase-1 (DPEP1), and acts as a progenitor reservoir sustaining and regenerating the follicle's mesenchymal compartments.\")\n35212: AnnotationAssertion(terms:contributor obo:CL_4072103 <https://orcid.org/0009-0000-8480-9277>)\n35213: AnnotationAssertion(oboInOwl:creation_date obo:CL_4072103 \"2025-11-05T11:49:53Z\"^^xsd:dateTime)\n35214: AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"PMID:38016881\") oboInOwl:hasNarrowSynonym obo:CL_4072103 \"dermal sheath cup cell\")\n35215: AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"PMID:25465495\") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasSynonymType obo:OMO_0003000) oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym obo:CL_4072103 \"hfDSC\")\n35216: AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label obo:CL_4072103 \"hair follicle dermal stem cell\")\n35217: EquivalentClasses(obo:CL_4072103 ObjectIntersectionOf(obo:CL_0000134 ObjectSomeValuesFrom(obo:BFO_0000050 obo:UBERON_0002073)))\n35218: SubClassOf(obo:CL_4072103 ObjectSomeValuesFrom(obo:RO_0002215 obo:GO_0042634))\n35219: \n35220: # Class: obo:CL_7770002 (juxtacanalicular tissue cell)\n35221: \n35222: AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"PMID:25356439\") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"PMID:32341164\") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"PMID:39829808\") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:CL_7770002 \"A trabecular meshwork cell of the juxtacanalicular tissue (JCT), characterized by a spindle-shaped, fibroblast-like morphology within a loose extracellular matrix immediately adjacent to Schlemm's canal. It expresses CHI3L1 (human and mouse) and ANGPTL7 (human), as well as smooth muscle actin for contractility. Unlike other trabecular meshwork cells, it does not form monolayers but exists in a loose network, regulating aqueous humor outflow resistance through continuous ECM remodelling, mechanotransduction, and formation of intracellular pores historically called giant vacuoles.\")\n35223: AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000233 obo:CL_7770002 \"https://github.com/obophenotype/cell-ontology/issues/3275\")\n35224: AnnotationAssertion(terms:contributor obo:CL_7770002 <https://orcid.org/0009-0000-8480-9277>)\n35225: AnnotationAssertion(oboInOwl:creation_date obo:CL_7770002 \"2025-01-29T08:52:00Z\"^^xsd:dateTime)\n35226: AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"PMID:32341164\") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasSynonymType obo:OMO_0003000) oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym obo:CL_7770002 \"JCT cell\")\n35227: AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label obo:CL_7770002 \"juxtacanalicular tissue cell\")\n35228: SubClassOf(obo:CL_7770002 obo:CL_0000327)\n35229: SubClassOf(obo:CL_7770002 obo:CL_0002367)\n35230: SubClassOf(obo:CL_7770002 ObjectSomeValuesFrom(obo:RO_0002215 obo:GO_0070278))\n35231: \n35232: # Class: obo:CL_7770003 (beam A cell)\n35233: \n35234: AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"PMID:27443500\") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"PMID:32341164\") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"PMID:39829808\") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:CL_7770003 \"A beam cell within the eye's trabecular meshwork, molecularly distinguished by FABP4 expression in humans and spatially intermingled with Beam B cells throughout the uveal and corneoscleral meshwork regions. In mice, a transcriptionally analogous Beam A–like cluster (mC14) exists, sharing core TM markers (Myoc, Mgp, Pdpn, Chil1) and functional attributes.\")\n\n(Showing lines 35195-35234 of 35350. Use offset=35235 to continue.)\n</content>","metadata":{"preview":"AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label obo:CL_4072046 \"pvalb chandelier GABAergic interneuron (Homo sapiens)\")\nSubClassOf(obo:CL_4072046 obo:CL_4023036)\nSubClassOf(obo:CL_4072046 ObjectSomeValuesFrom(obo:RO_0002162 obo:NCBITaxon_9606))\nSubClassOf(obo:CL_4072046 ObjectSomeValuesFrom(obo:RO_0015004 obo:CLM_1000063))\n\n# Class: obo:CL_4072102 (Purkinje layer interneuron)\n\nAnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"PMID:35803588\") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:CL_4072102 \"A type of GABAergic interneuron residing in the Purkinje cell layer of the cerebellar cortex.\")\nAnnotationAssertion(terms:date obo:CL_4072102 \"2025-04-29T13:06:36Z\"^^xsd:dateTime)\nAnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"PMID:35803588\") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasSynonymType obo:OMO_0003000) oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym obo:CL_4072102 \"PLI\")\nAnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label obo:CL_4072102 \"Purkinje layer interneuron\")\nEquivalentClasses(obo:CL_4072102 ObjectIntersectionOf(obo:CL_0000099 ObjectSomeValuesFrom(obo:RO_0002100 obo:UBERON_0002979)))\nSubClassOf(obo:CL_4072102 ObjectSomeValuesFrom(obo:RO_0002215 obo:GO_0061534))\n\n# Class: obo:CL_4072103 (hair follicle dermal stem cell)\n\nAnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"PMID:25465495\") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"PMID:29691589\") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"PMID:35036581\") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"PMID:35069694\") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:CL_4072103 \"A bipotent mesenchymal stem cell that resides in the dermal sheath, specifically within the dermal sheath cup at the base of the hair follicle, characterized by its capacity for self-renewal and differentiation into both dermal sheath and dermal papilla cells throughout hair cycling. In humans, this cell is marked by enriched expression of gremlin-2 (GREM2) and dipeptidase-1 (DPEP1), and acts as a progenitor reservoir sustaining and regenerating the follicle's mesenchymal compartments.\")\nAnnotationAssertion(terms:contributor obo:CL_4072103 <https://orcid.org/0009-0000-8480-9277>)\nAnnotationAssertion(oboInOwl:creation_date obo:CL_4072103 \"2025-11-05T11:49:53Z\"^^xsd:dateTime)\nAnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"PMID:38016881\") oboInOwl:hasNarrowSynonym obo:CL_4072103 \"dermal sheath cup cell\")","truncated