{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1778978083929,"sessionID":"ses_1cca74304ffesK7pZ7OOL2KJ8q","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"apply_patch","callID":"call_z28X4jlap8bc5O1RwkLkprGd","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"patchText":"*** Begin Patch\n*** Add File: /__w/eval-ont-agent-cl/eval-ont-agent-cl/ISSUE_COMMENTS.md\n+Implemented the requested new term and committed the ontology change locally.\n+\n+Added `transitional principal-intercalated cell of kidney collecting duct` as a new subclass of `kidney collecting duct epithelial cell`, with definition, issue link, ORCID contributors, and the requested synonyms supported by PMID:33893305 and PMID:37468583.\n+\n+Changes committed in PR #<NN>.\n*** Add File: /__w/eval-ont-agent-cl/eval-ont-agent-cl/PR_COMMENTS.md\n+Added a new CL term for `transitional principal-intercalated cell of kidney collecting duct` in `src/ontology/cl-edit.owl`.\n+\n+What changed:\n+- Added a new class with NTR-range ID `CL_9900000`.\n+- Added the label `transitional principal-intercalated cell of kidney collecting duct`.\n+- Added a textual definition citing PMID:33893305 and PMID:37468583.\n+- Added the issue tracker link to CL issue `#3259`.\n+- Added both requested ORCID contributors.\n+- Added the requested synonym content:\n+  - `tPC-IC cell` as a related synonym with abbreviation synonym type, supported by PMID:37468583.\n+  - `hybrid principal-intercalated cell` as a broad synonym, supported by PMID:33893305.\n+- Placed the new term under `kidney collecting duct epithelial cell` (`CL_1000454`).\n+\n+Rationale:\n+- The issue and follow-up discussion support adding a transitional or hybrid collecting-duct epithelial cell type that co-expresses principal-cell and intercalated-cell markers.\n+- I used the conservative parent `kidney collecting duct epithelial cell` rather than asserting it as a subclass of either the principal-cell or intercalated-cell branch, because the request describes a transitional hybrid state rather than a committed su